"The Z83 is required for public service (government) jobs. Details from your CV are already filled in. Answer every question: incomplete forms may not be considered.": [
"Z83 e a hlokahala bakeng sa mesebetsi ya tshebeletso ya setjhaba (mmuso). Dintlha tse tswang ho CV ya hao di se di tladitswe. Araba potso e nngwe le e nngwe: diforomo tse sa phethelwang di ka nna tsa se ke tsa shejwa.",
"I-Z83 iyadingeka emisebenzini kahulumeni. Imininingwane evela ku-CV yakho isivele igcwalisiwe. Phendula yonke imibuzo: amafomu angaphelele angase anganakwa.",
"Die Z83 word vir staatsdiensposte (regeringsposte) vereis. Besonderhede uit jou CV is reeds ingevul. Beantwoord elke vraag: onvolledige vorms word dalk nie oorweeg nie."
],
